// 同步查询缓存。key 不存在表示尚未求值，evaluating 表示当前调用链正在求值，
// ready 表示结果已经发布。

import map = "../support/map.jiang";

@where(V: Copyable)
public union QueryCacheState<V>: Copyable {
    Void missing;
    Void evaluating;
    V ready;
}

// 通用 per-query cache 原语：同步求值状态 + memo + epoch reset。
// entry 不存在表示 missing，null value 表示 evaluating，非 null 表示 ready。
@region(k, v)
@where(K: Hashable & Equatable & Copyable, V: Copyable)
public struct QueryCache<K, V>: Movable {
    @life(k, v)
    map.WyHashMap<K, V?> entries!;

    public init(self) {
        self.entries = map.WyHashMap<K, V?>();
    }

    public Void reset(Self&! self) {
        self.entries.clear();
    }

    public V? lookup(self, K key) {
        guard self.entries.get(key) is .some(entry) else { return null; }
        guard entry$.get() is .some(value) else { return null; }
        return value;
    }

    public V? peek(self, K key) {
        guard self.entries.get(key) is .some(entry) else { return null; }
        return entry$.get();
    }

    public QueryCacheState<V> state(Self&! self, K key) {
        guard self.entries.get(key) is .some(entry) else {
            self.entries.set(key, null);
            QueryCacheState<V> state = .missing();
            return state;
        }
        guard entry$.get() is .some(value) else {
            QueryCacheState<V> state = .evaluating();
            return state;
        }
        QueryCacheState<V> state = .ready(value);
        return state;
    }

    public Bool is_evaluating(self, K key) {
        guard self.entries.get(key) is .some(entry) else { return false; }
        return entry$.get() == null;
    }

    public Void complete(Self&! self, K key, V value) {
        assert(self.is_evaluating(key));
        self.entries.set(key, value);
    }

    // L2 恢复或不需要递归检测的直接发布路径。
    public Void publish(Self&! self, K key, V value) {
        self.entries.set(key, value);
    }

    public Void remove(Self&! self, K key) {
        self.entries.remove(key);
    }
}
